          "type": "text",
          "value": "Repairing and Replacing Teeth with Care"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Teeth can become damaged through decay, wear, cracks or injury, and sometimes they are lost altogether. Restorative dentistry aims to repair and replace teeth so you can eat, speak and smile comfortably again."
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "At Precision Dental, restorative care begins with a detailed assessment using digital X-rays, intra-oral photographs and, where needed, a digital OPG. We explain what we find and discuss every suitable option with you, from the most conservative approach to more comprehensive treatment, so you can choose what feels right."
        },
        {
